{"baseline":{"timeout_pct":0.01,"avg_sec":135.26,"success_pct":0.955},"task":"[Автозадача из бэклога] [deep-agent/reliability-model/deepseek-v4-flash] brittle-process-supervision -- The supervisor uses Start-Process with -NoNewWindow -PassThru but does not monitor the child process\u0027s health (e.g., via process exit events or periodic health checks). It only checks $srv.HasExited and $proc.HasExited on each loop iteration (every ~3 seconds). A process that hangs (not exits) will never be detected as dead, and the supervisor will not restart it. | Recommend: Add a health-check mechanism: periodically verify the child process is responsive (e.g., check its main window handle, send a test request to the server API, or monitor its CPU/memory usage). If the process is unresponsive for N consecutive checks, kill and restart it.","commit":"5c27594a3d57cd60da0c6f7cd4a839135905d95d","type":"hypothesis","ts":"2026-05-30T10:07:20.5644383Z"}
